09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-03-03T11:20:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T17:36:12Z","closed_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103504","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103504.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103504.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:23Z"},"body":"* For physics bodies that are on non-interpolated branches\r\n\r\n4.x version of #103355\r\nHelps address https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103232#issuecomment-2687414358\r\n\r\n![non_interp_warning_4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85394632-23d4-439d-8182-2383bd0992b8)\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* I had not encountered this before, but it may not be obvious to users that physics bodies won't work correctly on non-interpolated branches of the scene tree.\r\n* This is simple to add and warns of the problem, and how to fix it.\r\n* The warning will show even in projects not using physics interpolation, but in most cases users will not have been changing `physics_interpolation_mode` except by accident. There's not a super easy way to check the global interpolation switch in the editor (except via the project setting) as it is hard coded OFF in the editor.\r\n* It is also possible to add some warnings at runtime for this (perhaps if the user switches interpolation mode of a branch at runtime) but seems less likely and can be added in a follow up PR.\r\n* Feel free to suggest changes to the wording / text formatting.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103504/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103504/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}